      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Penta Housing Application System</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500">Applications for households and a private review workspace for the membership committee</p>
    </header>

    <div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg space-y-8 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What it is</h2>
        <p>The <strong>Penta Housing Application System</strong> includes the applicant experience at <a class="text-green-700 underline hover:text-green-800" href="https://applications.pentacoop.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">applications.pentacoop.com</a> and a private committee workspace at <a class="text-green-700 underline hover:text-green-800" href="https://screener.pentacoop.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">screener.pentacoop.com</a>. Committee access is limited to authorized members.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">What it does</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">Applicants save and submit their information directly in Penta's application service. The system:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 mb-3">
          <li>keeps private working copies and dated submissions;</li>
          <li>tracks which current openings each household enters;</li>
          <li>applying the co-op's eligibility rules (such as household size and income ranges);</li>
          <li>helping committee members organize, compare, and prioritize applications into a shortlist for the committee to consider.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The tool supports the committee's work; it does not make membership decisions. Final decisions are always made by people, following the co-op's bylaws and process.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">How it uses Google sign-in</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">Applicants and authorized committee members may sign in with their Google account for identity only. Signing in does not give Penta access to their Google Drive, Gmail, or other Google data.</p>
        <p>For full detail on what information the app collects and how it is used, see our <a class="text-green-700 underline hover:text-green-800" href="/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>
